# P5 on GtkBackend on macOS (TEST_BACKEND=gtk4): #675 -- alerts on two windows at once, and three alerts stacked on one, each dismissed with Return.
# Measured 2026-10-16 from p5-macos-gtk4-final-20261016-020757.png (1180x816, 2x, halved; origin=frame, 28 pt native title bar). The AppKit file's Open another window click (270,202) landed below its button on GTK's taller layout, so the alerts were logged as Main: and the two-window half never ran (gtk4-aim-20261016.csv2).
# Open another window (295,181), Show Alert A (68,227), Show A+B+C at once (295,273): button centres. The last two AppKit clicks also landed; they are centred here.
# A coordinate cannot fix the other finding: on 2026-10-16 GTK logged Alert A, B, C dismissed (earliest on top). p5-debug-events.log must list C, B, A.
# After this file Ready. must be back and the log must hold Secondary: lines as well as Main: lines.
# macOS 上 GtkBackend 的 P5:Open another window 重新瞄準 (295,181);警示順序 A、B、C 是 GtkBackend 的缺陷，座標修不了。
